1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,374
Ranchi ka ek goalkeeper, last over ka sabse bharosemand khiladi kaise ban gaya? Video ke end tak ruko.

2
00:00:07,424 --> 00:00:12,287
Ranchi, 1981. Chhote Dhoni goal mein khade rehte the. Chhakke maarna to list mein tha hi nahi.

3
00:00:12,337 --> 00:00:18,072
Phir Kharagpur station par train ticket examiner ki naukri. Din mein platform, sapna saath mein.

4
00:00:18,122 --> 00:00:22,106
2007. Ek naye captain ne pehla T20 World Cup utha liya.

5
00:00:22,156 --> 00:00:31,128
Lekin jis pal ko India aaj bhi baar baar dekhta hai, woh chaar saal door tha.

6
00:00:31,178 --> 00:00:42,983
April 2011, Mumbai. World Cup final. 91 not out, aur chhakke se match khatam. Karodon dilon ne ek saath saans li.

7
00:00:43,033 --> 00:00:44,948
Atthaaees saal baad, India phir world champion.

8
00:00:44,998 --> 00:00:52,793
2013 mein Champions Trophy ne unhe banaya aisa akela captain, jisne teeno bade ICC white-ball trophy jeete.

9
00:00:52,843 --> 00:00:59,472
Phir aayi yellow army. Chennai ke saath paanch IPL titles. Log unhe Captain Cool kehte the.

10
00:00:59,522 --> 00:01:04,743
Aaj, atharah saal baad, unhone IPL se retirement le li.

11
00:01:04,793 --> 00:01:10,230
Lekin ruko. Woh ja nahi rahe. Chennai ne unhe 2027 ke liye team mentor banaya hai.

12
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:19,622
To unhone yeh kaise kiya? Shaant rehkar, jab baaki sab ghabra jaate the. Kuch khiladi match khatam karte hain. Unhone shak khatam kiye.

13
00:01:19,672 --> 00:01:25,394
Agla part: 2011 final, ball by ball. Follow karo, taaki miss na ho.

